@startwbs
skinparam BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam TitleFontColor #1E293B

<style>
wbsDiagram {
  .board {
    BackgroundColor #F2F9FF
    RoundCorner 10
    LineColor #2980B9
    LineThickness 2.0
    FontColor #1E293B
    FontStyle bold
  }
  .dept {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDF2
    RoundCorner 10
    LineColor #D35400
    LineThickness 1.5
    FontColor #1E293B
  }
}
</style>

title Predictra Organizational Structure

* Predictra Board <<board>>
** Threat Research\nDepartment <<dept>>
** Security Engineering\nDepartment <<dept>>
** Sales & Operations\nDepartment <<dept>>
@endwbs
